      "content": "thanks. can you finish the tone for the bargain hunter? also, i really need that third profile we talked about—the one for customers who might be \"difficult\" or acting suspicious. can you give some specific details on what these types of people look like and how the staff should handle them differently from the VIPs? like, what are the physical or behavioral red flags they should be looking out for?",
